# SYNTHETIC FIXTURE: written by hand from the metric names and help texts found in libllama-server-impl.so of the
# pinned image (llama.cpp build b10156) and listed in the server README at that tag. It is NOT a captured scrape:
# a scrape needs a loaded model, and no model was started to make this file. The values are made up.
